# Scute Swarm at six or more lands (CR 608.2c): the same 1/1, cast on turn 1 the same way, makes a plain Insect on
# turns 3, 5 and 7 (two, three and four lands), and on turn 9 with five lands still a plain fourth Insect, never a copy.
# On turn 11 the sixth land resolves with six lands, so the ability copies Scute Swarm itself instead (CR 707.2) and no
# fifth Insect arrives; one trigger makes exactly one copy, so no third Scute Swarm.
